     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRInformantLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRInformantLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRInformantLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-informant</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-informant</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>informant</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:professional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>informant.assignedEntity</td><td>L'informateur professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>informant.assignedEntity</td><td>L'informateur structure est de type FRLMOrganisation, cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>informant.assignedEntity</td><td>L'informateur patient/usager est de type FRLMPatient, cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:relatedPerson</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>informant.relatedEntity</td><td>L'informateur personne liée au patient est de type FRLMRelatedPerson, cf. FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-informant</code> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-informant-extension.html\">Informant Extensionversion : 1.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension (Informant Extension)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:professional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(Organization) — cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x] (Value of extension)</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(Patient) — cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMInformant.informant:relatedPerson</td><td><a h